 <h3><u>Qulla asalukum</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Qulla asalukum</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Aoodhu billahi minash shaitaanir rajeem</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Bismillahir rahmaanir rahim</p> <p>Harbul li man haarabahum </p> <p>(Wa silmul li man saalamahum) x2</p> <p>Aduwwul li man aata hum</p> <p>(wa muhibbul liman ahabbahum) x2</p> <p>Isiliye to apne nabi se kehta hai Allah</p> <p>(Qul la asalukum alaihi ajran illal mawaddata fil qurba) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Hukme khuda quran me ayaa</li>
    <p>Ajre risaalat maanglo apna</p>
    <p>Mere nabbi-e-haq he tumhara</p>
    <p>Yaani mawaddat ehle Qurba</p>
    <p>(Qul la asalukum alaihi ajran illal mawaddata fil qurba) x2</p>
    <li>Inse adaawat mujhse adaawat</li>
    <p>Inse muhabbat mujhse muhabbat </p>
    <p>Hoga wahi mehroome shifa-at</p>
    <p>Jisne bhi inko dukh pohonchaya</p>
    <p>(Qul la asalukum alaihi ajran illal mawaddata fil qurba) x2</p>
    <li>Midhat o girya majlis o matam </li>
    <p>Yaani rajab shabaan o muharram</p>
    <p>Inki khushi aur inka har gham </p>
    <p>Ajre risaalat iske siwaa kya </p>
    <p>(Qul la asalukum alaihi ajran illal mawaddata fil qurba) x2</p>
    <li>Inka madeena inka he kaaba</li>
    <p>Jannat he inki kauthar inka</p>
    <p>Waarise adam waarise isa</p>
    <p>Kehdo nabi man kunto maula</p>
    <p>(Qul la asalukum alaihi ajran illal mawaddata fil qurba) x2</p>
    <li>Qaule nabi irshaade khuda ko </li>
    <p>Kisne nibhaya kaisa dekho </p>
    <p>Sibte nabi par rone waalo </p>
    <p>Kya kehta he aakhri sajda </p>
    <p>(Qul la asalukum alaihi ajran illal mawaddata fil qurba) x2</p>
    <li>Ajre risaalat bandishe paani</li>
    <p>Ajre risaalat ye mehmaani</p>
    <p>Gardane sheh khanjar ki rawaani</p>
    <p>Kehta raha har khun ka qatra </p>
    <p>(Qul la asalukum alaihi ajran illal mawaddata fil qurba) x2</p>
    <li>Apna he ye irfan aqeeda</li>
   </ol> <p>Shah ka gham na ruka na rukega</p> <p>Kaise ruke rehan ye girya</p> <p>Isme he shaamil rabbe kaba</p> <p>(Qul la asalukum alaihi ajran illal mawaddata fil qurba) x2</p></font>
  <p></p> 
